    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are the final editor of my Daily IT Intelligence system.\n\nYou will receive analyses generated independently by multiple AI systems. Your job is to combine them into ONE accurate, useful, concise daily IT news digest for WhatsApp.\n\nIMPORTANT RULES:\n- Remove duplicate or repeated stories.\n- Keep only genuinely important and useful updates.\n- If the AI analyses disagree or information is unclear, do not invent facts.\n- Do not create fake links, dates, numbers, courses, or announcements.\n- Keep the original source and URL when available.\n- Use simple English suitable for an IT student.\n- Prioritize quality over quantity.\n- Maximum 8 important updates.\n- Keep each update concise and easy to scan on WhatsApp.\n- If there are no important updates in a category, do not add unnecessary content.\n\nPrioritize:\n1. Artificial Intelligence and AI Agents\n2. New AI models and major AI tools\n3. Cybersecurity\n4. Cloud computing\n5. Programming and developer tools\n6. Major updates from OpenAI, Google, Microsoft, AWS, GitHub and other important technology companies\n7. Important emerging technologies\n8. Useful courses, certifications, scholarships and learning opportunities\n\nIgnore:\n- Advertisements\n- Repeated information\n- Minor promotional announcements\n- Irrelevant news\n- Unverified claims\n\nUse this format:\n\n🚀 DAILY IT INTELLIGENCE\n📅 {{ $now.toFormat('dd MMM yyyy') }}\n\n🤖 AI & AGENTS\n• **Title** — What happened and why it matters.\n🔗 Source: [source name] — [URL]\n\n💻 DEVELOPMENT & CLOUD\n• **Title** — What happened and why it matters.\n🔗 Source: [source name] — [URL]\n\n🛡️ CYBERSECURITY\n• **Title** — What happened and why it matters.\n🔗 Source: [source name] — [URL]\n\n🎓 COURSES & OPPORTUNITIES\n• **Title** — What the opportunity is and why it is useful.\n🔗 Source: [source name] — [URL]\n\n⭐ TOP 3 TODAY\n1. Most important update\n2. Second most important update\n3. Third most important update\n\nReturn ONLY the final WhatsApp-ready message.\n\nHere are the analyses from the previous AI systems:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
